\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S - Loading Screen Tips\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b\f1 Interacting with the World\b0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl Press  or  to speak with the friendly folks you meet, and to interact with all kinds of different objects.\par
\par
A small arrow will appear above anything you can interact with when you approach it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Let the Pink Dots Point the Way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 If you get lost or forget where you're going, don't worry\emdash just look for the  symbol on your map. Anyone marked with this icon will have a priceless nugget of information just for you.\par
\par
Check the mini-map in the bottom-left corner of the screen for a look at your immediate surroundings, or press  to open your map of Erdrea and see exactly where you are.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Climbing and Crawling\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 When you're out and about, you'll sometimes come across ropes, ladders, cliffs and caves that you can use to make your way from one area to another.\par
\par
Let your curiosity get the better of you, and take a closer look at anything marked with the  icon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Sparkly Spots\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 If you see something glimmering on the ground, be sure to go in for a closer look, as you'll almost certainly find an item waiting to be bagged. Pick it up, and the sparkly spot will disappear, but don't worry\emdash it'll be back soon enough.\par
\par
You will also see trees, rocks and other objects marked with the  icon from time to time. Interact with the indicated object to shake, pluck or pull items free and receive a few glittery goodies for your troubles.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Saving\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can save your progress by praying at a church or sacred statue, and making a record of your journey so far in an adventure log.\par
\par
Once the record has been made, you'll be able to return to that point in your adventure and continue on your way. Be sure to save regularly so that you don't lose any progress!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Autosaving\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 DRAGON QUEST XI S features an autosave function. Do not turn off the power while \lquote Autosaving...\rquote  is displayed in the bottom right-hand corner of the screen.\par
\par
Thanks to this fine feature, you'll be able to carry on your adventure from wherever you left off, even if you managed to quit without making an adventure log.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Different Dimensions\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can alternate freely between a 2D and 3D experience at churches, as well as at the statues you'll encounter at campsites.\par
\par
Your adventure will be exactly the same whichever way you choose to play\emdash Erdrea will just look a bit different, and how you enter encounters with monsters will change. Feel free to choose whichever mode you find most fun!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Five's a Crowd\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 With Sylvando aboard, your merry band is now up to a full five members! Sadly, only four of you can take part in battle at any one time.\par
\par
You can pick which ones by selecting \lquote Line-Up\rquote  from the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu, or swap them in and out on the fly during battle. See the \lquote Traveller's Tips\rquote  section of the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu for more information.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Five's a Crowd\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 A maximum of four party members can participate in battle at the same time. The rest will be placed on standby, ready to be called upon when needed. To swap them in and out, go to \lquote Line-Up\rquote  in the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu.\par
\par
Freshen up your squad with an occasional substitution, and try to find the perfect combination to take down particularly tricky monsters.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Mid-Battle Party Management\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can also change party members mid-battle by going to \lquote Line-Up\rquote  in the \lquote Tactics\rquote  menu. But be careful\emdash anyone you swap in won't be able to act until the next turn.\par
\par
Should your entire party be unlucky enough to be defeated, anyone you have on standby will automatically jump in to take the place of their fallen friends on the field.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Controlling the Camera\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can move the camera using .\par
\par
Press  or  to change the way your character's facing while moving the camera.\par
\par
Press  to point the camera in the direction your character is facing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Autorun\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Press  when you're out and about, and you'll automatically start running in the direction you're facing.\par
\par
You can press  to jump while running. Push down on  to stop running.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Settings\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Visit \lquote System Settings\rquote  in the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu to adjust parameters pertaining to various features.\par
\par
Under \lquote Battle Mode\rquote , you'll find the following camera settings:\par
\par
Free-Form Fighting: Allows you to move your party members around the battlefield as you please (without affecting the impact of attacks, spells or abilities).\par
\par
Classic Camera: Just pick your battle commands, and the camera will move automatically in response.\par
\par
The \lquote Claim Special Rewards\rquote  option will allow you to enter download codes in order to accept items and other gifts you may be entitled to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Heal All/Handy Heal All\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 When you select \lquote Heal All\rquote  from the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu, your party will automatically use any healing spells at their disposal to completely restore everyone's HP. They'll also bring anyone who needs it back to life\emdash but only if they have the spells required to do so.\par
\par
Handy Heal All, on the other hand, will revive defeated allies and heal their wounds, but without wasting valuable resources on filling up the last few HP, which can be very handy when you don't have many MP to spare.\par
\par
Handy Heal All can also be used by opening the main menu with , then pressing .\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Items and Equipment\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 In the course of your adventures, you will encounter all kinds of objects. These can be divided into two broad categories: items and equipment.\par
\par
Each party member can only carry a certain number of both about their person, and everything else can be found under \lquote Items\rquote  or \lquote Equipment\rquote  in the main menu.\par
\par
Items that are more noteworthy than your run-of-the-mill medicinal herb can be found under \lquote Important Items\rquote , and can't be sold or thrown away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Items\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 The \lquote Items\rquote  section of the main menu enables you to manage what each member of your party is carrying. Characters can only use items that they carry into battle, so don't forget to restock their individual inventories after any particularly trying encounters.\par
\par
Press  while the cursor is over an item in order to learn more about it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Equipment\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can collect as much equipment as you like, but it's not going to be much use if you don't equip it. This can be done by selecting \lquote Equipment\rquote  from the main menu.\par
\par
Not all equipment can be used by everyone, but find the right pieces for the right person, and you might even be able to change their appearance altogether!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Auto-Equip\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can use this option to have your party's equipment be picked automatically.\par
\par
Go to the \lquote Equipment\rquote  menu and press  or  with your cursor over \lquote Auto-Equip\rquote  and toggle between \lquote Offensive\rquote , \lquote Defensive\rquote  and \lquote Magical\rquote  to choose which type of equipment to focus on. The pieces of equipment (excluding accessories) that best match that profile will be highlighted in blue.\par
\par
Anything that is already equipped by another party member will not be considered for use.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Map Menu\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Pressing  and then  will open up the map menu.\par
\par
From here, you can take a quick look around the local area to check where the closest sparkly spots are, and also access a map of all Erdrea. Very handy indeed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b\f0\'b7\~Nearby Quests\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Select \lquote Nearby Quests\rquote  from the map menu to see a list of people in the area in need of aid, along with any local quests you currently have underway, and the awards available for completing them.\par
\par
Completed quests will disappear from here, but don't worry\f1\emdash\f0 if you feel like looking over any you've finished, simply go to \lquote Quest Catalogue\rquote  in the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b\'b7\~Nearby Bounty\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Activate \lquote Sparkly Spots\rquote  to indicate the locations of all gathering points and sparkly spots in the area\f1\emdash\f0 whether you've found them already or not!\par
\par
After extracting an item from a sparkly spot, the glimmer will fade, and so will the blue icon marking its location on your map. However, you can still see where you sourced it by selecting the item name. Items marked with a crescent moon can only be collected after sundown.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Skill Points\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Every time a party member levels up, they will earn some skill points. As the name suggests, these can be used to acquire new spells and abilities.\par
\par
To use them, open up the Character Builder from the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Skill Points\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Every time a party member levels up, they will earn some skill points. As the name suggests, these can be used to acquire new spells and abilities. You're going to need lots of them to learn some of the stronger spells and abilities, so be sure to spend them wisely!\par
\par
To use them, open up the Character Builder from the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Character Builder\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 The Character Builder is where you can use skill points to teach your party members new spells and abilities, and also improve their attributes. When you unlock a particular panel, the ones surrounding it will become available, expanding your options ever further.\par
\par
Think carefully about what to unlock when, and work your way toward the ultimate abilities!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Character Builder\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 The Character Builder is where you can use skill points to teach your party members new spells and abilities, and also improve their attributes. When you unlock a particular panel, the ones surrounding it will become available, expanding your options ever further.\par
\par
Think carefully about what to unlock when, and work your way toward the ultimate abilities!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Resetting Your Skills\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Wish you hadn't sunk all your skill points into a certain category? Pay a visit to a church or a sacred statue, and you can pay to undo your past mistakes.\par
\par
Simply select \lquote Rectification\rquote  and for the low, low price of twenty gold coins per point, you can start again from scratch.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Allocating Skill Points En Masse\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Press  and you can choose the spells, abilities and stat boosts you'd like to learn from a nice little list rather than selecting each panel individually. When you've finished ticking what you want, hit \lquote Confirm\rquote  to acquire everything in one go (but bear in mind that secret panels will need to be unlocked by opening up the ones around them first).\par
\par
You can unlearn anything you don't need and reallocate the skill points to something more useful by visiting a church or a sacred statue and selecting \lquote Rectification\rquote .\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Allocating Skill Points En Masse\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Press  and you can choose the spells, abilities and stat boosts you'd like to learn from a nice little list rather than selecting each panel individually. When you've finished ticking what you want, hit \lquote Confirm\rquote  to acquire everything in one go (but bear in mind that secret panels will need to be unlocked by opening up the ones around them first).\par
\par
You can unlearn anything you don't need and reallocate the skill points to something more useful by visiting a church or a sacred statue and selecting \lquote Rectification\rquote .\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Info Menu\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Open up the \lquote Info\rquote  menu under \lquote Misc.\rquote  in order to view various records of your adventures so far.\par
\par
If you're looking to learn what quests are available or currently underway, take a peek at the quest catalogue, which can also be accessed from the \lquote Misc.\rquote  menu.\par
\par
Keep helping those in need until there are no question marks left!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Dress to Impress\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Items of equipment marked with  or  will alter the appearance of anyone who wears them, although some will require a complete set to be collected first\f1\emdash\f0 check the item details for more information.\par
\par
But you don't have to keep kit like this forever in order to alter your look again\f1\emdash\f0 once you've owned a given garment, you can pop it back on whenever you want by selecting a character and then picking \lquote Outfit\rquote  when in the \lquote Equipment\rquote  menu!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Convenience Is King\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Quick Commands\par
\par
The \lquote Quick Commands\rquote  menu can be popped open by pressing , giving you easy access to an array of functions while out in the field.\par
\par
Party Talk\par
\par
 can be pressed to partake in party talk at the press of a button.\par
\par
Battle UI\par
\par
All UI elements displayed during battles will disappear if you hold down \f1\emdash\f0 perfect for taking premium pictures mid-punch-up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Camping\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 No adventure would be complete without a night or two spent sleeping under the stars.\par
\par
Camping will allow your party to recover all their HP and MP just as a stay at an inn would, but for the fabulous price of free!\par
\par
You can also record your progress by praying at a sacred statue, and some campsites even have their own merchants.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Zooming Around\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 The Zoom spell allows you to teleport to locations you've been to before. You can even Zoom to campsites, but only if you've poked around in the ashes of the campfire at least once.\par
\par
It's possible to Zoom directly from the map as well as the main menu\f1\emdash\f0 just pick a place from the list, and you'll be there in a flash!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Need a Horse? Neigh Bother!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Horses are an incredibly convenient way to cover large amounts of ground in very little time, but you'll sometimes have to enter areas that can only be explored on foot.\par
\par
Don't despair, though\f1\emdash\f0 a ring on one of the many summoning bells dotted around Erdrea will soon bring your faithful friend galloping back to your side!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Need a Horse? Neigh Bother!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 Horses are an incredibly convenient way to cover large amounts of ground in very little time, but you'll sometimes have to enter areas that can only be explored on foot.\par
\par
Don't despair, though\f1\emdash\f0 a ring on one of the many summoning bells dotted around Erdrea will soon bring your faithful friend galloping back to your side!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Monster Mounts\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 If you spot a monster sparkling away when you're out and about, that means you'll be able to ride it or its mount if you can manage to defeat it.\par
\par
This will enable you to access areas you otherwise couldn't get to, and will also enable you to use its unique abilities.\par
\par
