\par
Depending on the tactics each character has set, they'll either perform powers automatically or await your orders. Take a look at the Traveller's Tips to learn more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
