\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 A pep power is an incredible ability that can be performed by two or more party members, when at least one of them is pepped up. Some pep powers can only be unleashed when everyone involved is in this state.\par
\par
In most cases, participating party members will no longer be pepped up once the power has been performed.\par
\par
If you ever feel like powering through the associated animations, feel free to press , and if you want to see which powers your party have at your disposal, simply open up the \lquote Attributes\rquote  menu.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b Get Prepped to Pep\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
