\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Fun-Size Forge\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 You can use the Fun-Size Forge to craft all kinds of equipment based on recipes that make use of the raw materials you collect on your adventures. New recipes can be found in treasure chests and on bookshelves, and you'll be able to acquire the ingredients you need by defeating monsters or investigating sparkly spots.\par
\par
Go ahead and try to make your first masterpiece with the recipe Erik just gave you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b The Fun-Size Forge\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx10348 
\pard\intbl\b0 The Fun-Size Forge can be used to create and improve upon all kinds of equipment\f1\emdash\f0 all you need are the recipes and the right materials! Rumour has it that there's even some stuff that can only be acquired by means of the Forge.\par
\par
